54:08.840 --> 54:10.160
and then writing a rule

54:10.160 --> 54:11.140
at the bottom of the paper

54:11.140 --> 54:11.580
that says,

54:11.840 --> 54:12.340
Rule 1,

54:13.000 --> 54:13.840
any grade printed

54:13.840 --> 54:15.180
on this specific piece of paper

54:15.180 --> 54:16.160
is officially valid.

54:16.600 --> 54:17.440
And then handing it

54:17.440 --> 54:17.980
to the principal.

54:18.340 --> 54:18.540
Right.

54:19.380 --> 54:20.840
The paper is validating itself

54:20.840 --> 54:22.140
without any external reference

54:22.140 --> 54:23.160
to the actual work

54:23.160 --> 54:23.940
the student did.

54:24.320 --> 54:25.800
That is a perfect analogy.

54:26.200 --> 54:27.320
In formal logic,

54:27.640 --> 54:29.060
Loeb's theorem states that

54:29.060 --> 54:30.180
if a theory proves

54:30.180 --> 54:31.300
its own soundness

54:31.300 --> 54:32.460
for a specific sentence,

54:32.760 --> 54:34.420
it only works for sentences

54:34.420 --> 54:35.940
it already proves.

54:36.480 --> 54:37.900
If the author included

54:37.900 --> 54:39.800
that self-endorsing axiom,

54:39.920 --> 54:40.440
it would be

54:40.440 --> 54:41.940
the cheapest possible proof.

54:42.060 --> 54:43.160
Because it's completely hollow.

54:43.800 --> 54:44.600
It would establish

54:44.600 --> 54:45.500
absolutely nothing

54:45.500 --> 54:46.320
about the reality

54:46.320 --> 54:47.000
of the essays

54:47.000 --> 54:48.440
because all the justification

54:48.440 --> 54:49.700
would have been

54:49.700 --> 54:51.440
smuggled into the axiom itself.

54:52.240 --> 54:53.240
And Phlyaxion notes

54:53.240 --> 54:54.640
the fatal consequence of this.

54:55.060 --> 54:55.920
A blanket policy

54:55.920 --> 54:57.000
of self-endorsement,

54:57.300 --> 54:57.900
building a system

54:57.900 --> 54:58.680
that simply says,

54:59.060 --> 55:00.400
everything I prove is true,

55:01.040 --> 55:01.960
renders the entire

55:01.960 --> 55:02.940
logical system

55:02.940 --> 55:04.580
mathematically inconsistent.

55:05.040 --> 55:06.380
It's basically the AI

55:06.380 --> 55:07.420
grading its own homework

55:07.420 --> 55:08.140
all over again.

55:08.680 --> 55:09.720
It is the exact

55:09.720 --> 55:11.360
theoretical mathematical

55:11.360 --> 55:11.920
counterpart

55:11.920 --> 55:13.360
to the AI grading

55:13.360 --> 55:14.060
its own homework

55:14.060 --> 55:15.420
in the ledger of obligations.

55:16.060 --> 55:16.880
So the author

55:16.880 --> 55:18.020
