55:18.020 --> 55:20.200
and they refuse to use it.

55:20.700 --> 55:22.140
They refuse to let the math

55:22.140 --> 55:22.920
give them a fake

55:22.920 --> 55:24.500
circular permission slip.

55:25.100 --> 55:26.140
And because they refuse

55:26.140 --> 55:26.840
to smuggle in

55:26.840 --> 55:27.560
the value judgment,

55:28.200 --> 55:29.220
every single theorem

55:29.220 --> 55:29.900
in their massive

55:29.900 --> 55:30.860
proof-assistant code

55:30.860 --> 55:31.820
