55:33.620 --> 55:34.080
Admitted.

55:34.560 --> 55:34.840
Yes.

55:35.180 --> 55:36.320
In the programming language

55:36.320 --> 55:36.980
they were using,

55:37.180 --> 55:38.220
the command admitted

55:38.220 --> 55:39.420
means that a theorem

55:39.420 --> 55:40.040
is stated,

55:40.240 --> 55:41.520
but it remains unchecked

55:41.520 --> 55:42.060
